{"4260190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mine of my Mind", "steam_appid": 4260190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Mine of my Mind</strong></u> is a plunge into the oppressive world of Andrew. You will take on the role of a Miner to descend into the depths and experience the grueling routine of the mine. But when an ordinary shift suddenly turns into a nightmare, the mine becomes more than just a workplace. It becomes a trap in his own mind. Survive the horror lurking in the Mine as Andrew's mind crumbles like a pile of stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/357f007ba657a5ee8c01431629238e07.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/357f007ba657a5ee8c01431629238e07.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/357f007ba657a5ee8c01431629238e07.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player immerses themselves in a first-person narrative horror. The focus is on environmental interaction, location exploration, studying objects, and finding hidden details. Collect fragments to understand the bigger picture. Progress through the story by gathering clues. Every object found could be a piece of the puzzle revealing critical story elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/4e720185675c8f3d6dadeb6181ee703c.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/4e720185675c8f3d6dadeb6181ee703c.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/4e720185675c8f3d6dadeb6181ee703c.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE A MINER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The driving force of the game plot is the story of the miners, but the gameplay is not built around mining ore and resources. Characters are revealed from a different side, not as ordinary workers. This story is deeper than the deepest mine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/c856cb79333e5d1a1a893d7348ca8fcc.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/c856cb79333e5d1a1a893d7348ca8fcc.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/c856cb79333e5d1a1a893d7348ca8fcc.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be attentive…</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion in the plot is built through interactive dialogues with characters, finding notes, and hidden messages. Pay attention to small details...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/3933231cfff000ad208f4bded6c62495.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/3933231cfff000ad208f4bded6c62495.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/3933231cfff000ad208f4bded6c62495.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with unexpected plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay built on creating a sense of presence and a constant search for answers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elaborate sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues affecting the plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual unfolding of the narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/e2e8a56e97fb04ec74ccf6b8c1dfab22.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/e2e8a56e97fb04ec74ccf6b8c1dfab22.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/e2e8a56e97fb04ec74ccf6b8c1dfab22.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Mine of my Mind</strong></u> is a plunge into the oppressive world of Andrew. You will take on the role of a Miner to descend into the depths and experience the grueling routine of the mine. But when an ordinary shift suddenly turns into a nightmare, the mine becomes more than just a workplace. It becomes a trap in his own mind. Survive the horror lurking in the Mine as Andrew's mind crumbles like a pile of stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/357f007ba657a5ee8c01431629238e07.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/357f007ba657a5ee8c01431629238e07.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/357f007ba657a5ee8c01431629238e07.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player immerses themselves in a first-person narrative horror. The focus is on environmental interaction, location exploration, studying objects, and finding hidden details. Collect fragments to understand the bigger picture. Progress through the story by gathering clues. Every object found could be a piece of the puzzle revealing critical story elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/4e720185675c8f3d6dadeb6181ee703c.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/4e720185675c8f3d6dadeb6181ee703c.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/4e720185675c8f3d6dadeb6181ee703c.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p c