_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with unexpected plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay built on creating a sense of presence and a constant search for answers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elaborate sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues affecting the plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual unfolding of the narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/e2e8a56e97fb04ec74ccf6b8c1dfab22.poster.avif?t=1783539529\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/e2e8a56e97fb04ec74ccf6b8c1dfab22.webm?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/extras/e2e8a56e97fb04ec74ccf6b8c1dfab22.mp4?t=1783539529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "This is a horror where you play as a miner experiencing a midlife crisis. The final shift before a long-awaited promotion goes wrong: reality begins to warp, turning a workday into a nightmare. Will he be able to escape the depths of his own mind?", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/6d5daeea96667c1568f6fee734adcd62288cb227/header.jpg?t=1783539529", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260190/c9a229